{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是不再等待无损方案、继续做眼前的事以及劲头恢复，均属于心理选择和行动状态，没有新增具体事件或音乐术语。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把努力的要求从扭转一切调整为做好眼前能做的事，表达了心理要求的变化，没有越出珠子范围。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写清了对理想生活与眼前责任两头不舍、担心顾此失彼的内在冲突，没有添加具体人物关系或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"担忧重现、心里动摇和仍然前行都属于心理变化，也对应了珠子中不必假装无伤、无须等犹疑消失才坚定的意思。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-4已经明确再咬牙也难免伤到一边，直接说明他为什么不再等待毫无损失的办法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-6先接下眼前该担的事，可以解释他继续行动，但不足以单独解释久违的劲头为何恢复。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-2已经写明投入行动会带来力气、骄傲和痛快，能够解释此处重新行动时劲头回返。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-2说明行动带来的力气没有消除对那种生活的牵挂，可以提示努力未必解决一切，但没有直接推出他不再要求每次努力扭转局面。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-4已经说明安宁和争取都舍不得、再咬牙也难免伤到一边，直接构成此处顾此失彼的担忧。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-5已经写明争取可能耗掉温柔、心里仍疼但眼前的事不能搁置，能够解释担心重现却仍然前行。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-1确立了不等心里全明白就先承担一份的做法，S12-4将其发展为不必等犹疑消失也能坚定，前后转化清楚。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"前文已经交代那种生活的含义、眼前该做的事以及两头难以兼顾的原因，因此只读线也能读懂他从恢复行动到担忧重现、仍然选择前行的变化。\",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S12-3\",\n        \"S12-4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"S12-3已经说了心里没底也继续往前，S12-4又说带着不安往前走，重复表达了同一层意思，可以删去其中一处。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9007b6b4-0d7c-499f-906a-ed0da5e580b1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191241740737Z", "elapsed_seconds": 213.235, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:16:15.018897+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "602844205c5cc2a49deca1f09496425d8d56557481a6e7ba7629b526d2db4ac6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191241740737Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "84d8351de67c725a41297667d7d4